{{short description|Soup made with lettuce}}
[[File:Butter lettuce soup.jpg|thumb|290px|[[Lettuce#Cultivars|Butter lettuce]] soup with [[crouton]]s]]

'''Lettuce soup''' is a [[soup]] prepared with [[lettuce]] as a primary ingredient.<ref name="Haedrich"/> It may be prepared with additional ingredients, and some lettuce soups may use several cultivars of lettuce in their preparation. It is a part of [[French cuisine]] and [[Chinese cuisine]].<ref name="De Gouy"/><ref name="Simoons"/><ref name="David"/> Cream of lettuce soup is a type of lettuce soup<ref name="Roehl"/> prepared using milk or cream. The soup may be served with toast or rolls as a side dish or with the soup atop them. It may be served as an [[appetizer]], a side dish or as a main dish,<ref name="Aidells"/> and may be served hot or cold.<ref name="d'Avila-Latourrette"/>
